{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"huanchen-e-o080","title":"桓范荐宣为左仆射","accounts":[{"id":"huanchen-a-49cac3c30813d5b8e934","label":"正文","text":"桓范荐宣为左仆射","evidence":["huanchen-q-4acbb5c10c9b6ecef60e"]}],"participants":[{"person":"shaodi-p0030","role":"荐宣","evidence":["huanchen-q-4acbb5c10c9b6ecef60e"]},{"person":"huanchen-p0021","role":"遂为左仆射、加侍中光禄大夫","evidence":["huanchen-q-4acbb5c10c9b6ecef60e"]},{"person":"wendi-p0005","role":"以宣为左仆射","evidence":["huanchen-q-4acbb5c10c9b6ecef60e"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["huanchen-q-4acbb5c10c9b6ecef60e"]},"ordering_evidence":"huanchen-q-4acbb5c10c9b6ecef60e","source_order":[22,402,0],"order":4590}],"persons":[{"id":"huanchen-p0021","name":"徐宣","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"shaodi-p0030","name":"桓范","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wendi-p0005","name":"曹叡","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"huanchen-q-4acbb5c10c9b6ecef60e","section":"chapter-022","block":"b-9a7fe236edb28f433514","layer":"original","quote":"明帝即位，封津阳亭侯，邑二百户。中领军桓范荐宣曰〖3〗：“臣闻帝王用人，度世授才〖4〗：争夺之时，以策略为先；分定之后〖5〗，以忠义为首。故晋文行舅犯之计，而赏雍季之言〖6〗；﹝一﹞高祖用陈平之智，而托后于周勃也〖7〗。窃见尚书徐宣，体忠厚之行，秉直亮之性；清雅特立，不（拘）〔随〕世俗；确然难动〖8〗，有社稷之节；历位州郡，所在称职。今仆射缺，宣行掌后事；腹心任重，莫宜宣者〖9〗。”帝遂以宣为左仆射。后加侍中、光禄大夫","section_title":"桓二陈徐卫卢传第二十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0050.xhtml","index":401,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":211,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
